WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.770
"Do you mean I can go home?" shouted Toad.

2
00:00:04.771 --> 00:00:08.741
"Oh, I will sleep at Toad Hall again!"

3
00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:11.398
Toad jumped up and down.

4
00:00:11.399 --> 00:00:15.403
"Shh," the jailer’s daughter said.

5
00:00:15.404 --> 00:00:17.427
She looked around.

6
00:00:17.428 --> 00:00:20.702
"I have an aunt who is a washwoman.

7
00:00:20.703 --> 00:00:24.260
My aunt does the prison wash," she said.

8
00:00:24.261 --> 00:00:27.154
"What a hard job!" said Toad.

9
00:00:27.155 --> 00:00:30.039
"And for the whole prison too!

10
00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.259
Think of all the dirty clothes!"

11
00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:36.883
"Quiet, Toad," the daughter said. "Listen!"

12
00:00:36.884 --> 00:00:40.292
She continued, "Since you are rich . . ."

13
00:00:40.293 --> 00:00:44.270
"Well, I am rich," said Toad.

14
00:00:44.271 --> 00:00:47.685
"If you give her some money," she said,

15
00:00:47.686 --> 00:00:52.900
"my aunt will give you her dress and bonnet."

16
00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:56.622
"Why would I want her old dress?" said Toad.

17
00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:59.302
"To escape!" she said.

18
00:00:59.303 --> 00:01:02.297
"You can pretend to be her!"

19
00:01:02.298 --> 00:01:04.818
Toad was surprised.

20
00:01:04.819 --> 00:01:08.435
"Me? Dress like a washwoman?

21
00:01:08.436 --> 00:01:12.858
I am Toad of Toad Hall!" said Toad.

22
00:01:12.859 --> 00:01:16.447
He proudly shook his head.

23
00:01:16.448 --> 00:01:20.007
The jailer’s daughter got angry.

24
00:01:20.008 --> 00:01:24.445
"Maybe you can escape in a coach!" she shouted.

25
00:01:24.446 --> 00:01:27.306
"A coach with four horses!"

26
00:01:27.307 --> 00:01:31.028
She opened the door to leave.

27
00:01:31.029 --> 00:01:33.490
"I’m sorry," Toad said.

28
00:01:33.491 --> 00:01:35.535
"You are so nice.

29
00:01:35.536 --> 00:01:38.484
And I am a stupid toad."

30
00:01:38.485 --> 00:01:41.042
The jailer’s daughter stopped.

31
00:01:41.043 --> 00:01:45.770
"Introduce me to your aunt," said Toad.

